; Stage 15 W4b (design/stage15-stress-test/diagnostics.md §W4b): the
; colon-paren-fused shape of the same mistake. `K:(i32)` lexes as the atom
; "K:" immediately followed by "(i32)" and `fuse-colon-paren`
; (lib/reader.nuc) fuses them into the CELL `(K (i32))` before `emit-defconst`
; ever sees it -- so this must be rejected too, with the same message, not
; the generic "defconst: name must be symbol".
(defconst K:(i32) 2)

(defn main ():i32
  (return K))
